{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>THE MOUNTAIN WON\u2019T CLIMB ITSELF</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udef6 So grab your paddle and defy common sense.<br><br>Strap yourself into your kayak and prepare for a battle against a mountain that refuses to be conquered by paddle power alone. This isn't a leisurely stroll\u2014it\u2019s a grueling test of skill, determination, and your tolerance for repeated failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight against gravity, your own limitations, and the surprising currents that carve through this unforgiving peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget logic. Forget your legs. All you have is your kayak, your paddle, and an almost pathological need to reach the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/extras/802c46dd2353b21d2fd94101340f82be.poster.avif?t=1752728980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/extras/802c46dd2353b21d2fd94101340f82be.webm?t=1752728980\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/extras/802c46dd2353b21d2fd94101340f82be.mp4?t=1752728980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\ud83e\uddea <u><i><strong>What\u2019s in the Demo</strong></i></u>?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A full introductory section to test your sanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic voiceover reacting to your failures and progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectible golden fish and a time trial toggle</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A taste of the chaos that awaits in the full game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/extras/512e30193c56d65ea112cde6de720483.poster.avif?t=1752728980\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/extras/512e30193c56d65ea112cde6de720483.webm?t=1752728980\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/extras/512e30193c56d65ea112cde6de720483.mp4?t=1752728980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <u><i><strong>Features</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unforgivingly Realistic (and Ridiculous) Physics</strong><br>A paddling system so janky-yet-precise, you'll curse your own wrists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Golden Fish Collector</strong><br>Hidden in places only the most reckless or skilled players will reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br>Beat the demo? See how your time stacks up against paddlers worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rage-Inducing Satisfaction</strong><br>Every inch gained is pure joy. Every slip? A tragedy you'll swear was the game\u2019s fault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upper Body Strength Required (Sanity Optional)</strong><br>A workout for your fingers. And your soul.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827580?t=1752728980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/093a9996e846d9b8871087d245eb0b66ea35faf7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752728980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/7b7a941a49e4876a6b6801f618289466f6aae1a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752728980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827580/7b7a941a49e4876a6b6801f618289466f6aae1a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752728980","categories":[{"description":